    "text": "linknky.com\nwebsite\nElsmere\nElsmere authorizes contractor for city welcome sign\nBy Mildred Nguyen,\n8 hours agoThe city of Elsmere authorized a bid for a city welcome sign at their July 8 meeting. The city council approved a municipal order authorizing the mayor to enter a contract with Centric Constructions Inc. The company was chosen after entering a bid advertised by the city on June 11.\n1",
